Z||000013||MooCow||08-22-2001||10:34 PM||||Well the paint job isnt all that great. Has some of the yellow peeling away, but I cant complain for only $150 to get it painted.  I had to do all the prep work and buy only the paint, but all of it together was no more than $400.  I am going to get it re-shot next year and do a better job on the prep work.  This was my first time ever doing body work and I loved it to death.  I wet sanded the whole car in my garage in January with a non heated garage.  Trust me it was very cold.  Next year the car will have a lot better paint job.<P>Thanks Ken||||reg||10
